132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 75 0 R
/T (The analysis shows that permissions related to phone state, location access, and boot reception have the highest association with malicious applications, making them the riskiest permissions to grant. While internet and network-related permissions are commonly requested by both benign and malicious apps due to functional requirements, differences in their usage frequency suggest potential misuse by malware. Some permissions appear in both categories but at varying levels, indicating their value as indicators for identifying suspicious behavior.)
/E (The analysis shows that permissions related to phone state, location access, and boot reception have the highest association with malicious applications, making them the riskiest permissions to grant. While internet and network-related permissions are commonly requested by both benign and malicious apps due to functional requirements, differences in their usage frequency suggest potential misuse by malware. Some permissions appear in both categories but at varying levels, indicating their value as indicators for identifying suspicious behavior.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
